<h2 class="rv">Coventry’s dojo since 1957</h2>
<p class="lead rv">Coventry Judo Club has been running since 1957 within the Coventry area. Our dedicated coaches have an abundance of experience and are proud to be able to cater for all levels and offer lessons for children from 5+ ages. Training can be tailored to all individual’s abilities.</p>
