<div><p class="kicker rv">Membership</p><h2 class="rv">Your first session is free</h2></div>
<p class="lead rv" style="max-width:420px">Just come along to a session that suits your age and experience. All you need is comfortable clothing, enthusiasm, and an interest in learning a great martial art. Train occasionally? Pay as you go — no subscription required.</p>
</div>
<div class="plans">
<div class="plan rv"><h3>Juniors / Students</h3><div class="opt"><span>Single session per week</span><b>£20<small>/mo</small></b></div><div class="opt"><span>Unlimited sessions</span><b>£35<small>/mo</small></b></div></div>
<div class="plan hot rv"><h3>Family (Juniors)</h3><div class="opt"><span>Single session per week</span><b>£35<small>/mo</small></b></div><div class="opt"><span>Unlimited sessions</span><b>£60<small>/mo</small></b></div></div>
<div class="plan rv"><h3>Seniors</h3><div class="opt"><span>Single weekly session</span><b>£30<small>/mo</small></b></div><div class="opt"><span>Unlimited sessions</span><b>£55<small>/mo</small></b></div></div>
</div>
<p class="plans-note rv">Coventry Judo Club are members of the British Judo Association. To continue your judo journey you are required to gain your licence from the <a href="https://www.britishjudo.org.uk/my-judo/membership/">BJA</a> — it includes insurance, gradings, BJA competitions and retailer discounts.</p>
</div>
